[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631358841","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102369#issuecomment-2631358841","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102369","id":2631358841,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6c11l5","user":{"login":"kiroxas","id":3176062,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNzYwNjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3176062?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas","html_url":"https://github.com/kiroxas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-03T15:39:08Z","updated_at":"2025-02-03T15:39:08Z","body":"Do you have some timings after the changes ? ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631358841/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631394672","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102369#issuecomment-2631394672","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102369","id":2631394672,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6c1-Vw","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-03T15:52:48Z","updated_at":"2025-02-03T15:58:24Z","body":"> Do you have some timings after the changes ?\r\n\r\nNot really, as the `get_data` entry just disappears after this PR 😅\r\nIt may be notable though that `CodeEdit::_update_delimiter_cache(int, int)` was the sole impactful caller (owning all 1.3%), and its self time has not increased after the patch (due to inlining) but actually _decreased_ from 2.76 Gc to 2.57 Gc. \r\n\r\nThe change suggests a decrease of total load time by an average ~1.5%. I'd have to measure it several times to get reliable numbers, but in one test it decreased by about 4.5% from beta 2:\r\n\r\n- 41.27 Gc  100,0 %\t godot.macos.editor.arm64 (48296)\r\n- 43.18 Gc  100,0 %\t Godot4.4-beta2 (37735)\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631394672/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631471902","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102369#issuecomment-2631471902","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102369","id":2631471902,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6c2RMe","user":{"login":"kiroxas","id":3176062,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNzYwNjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3176062?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas","html_url":"https://github.com/kiroxas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-03T16:22:44Z","updated_at":"2025-02-03T16:22:44Z","body":"Looking at `_update_delimiter_cache`, the obvious solution would be to just use ptr() there in place of `get_data()`. Seems like someone used the wrong function in the first place. It would even be better than this version.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631471902/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631479336","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102369#issuecomment-2631479336","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102369","id":2631479336,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6c2TAo","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-03T16:25:44Z","updated_at":"2025-02-03T16:25:44Z","body":"> Looking at `_update_delimiter_cache`, the obvious solution would be to just use ptr() there in place of `get_data()`. Seems like someone used the wrong function in the first place. It would even be better than this version.\r\n\r\nThat's true! I considered that fix as well but decided improving `get_data` instead would be more ubiquitously useful. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631479336/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631497662","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102369#issuecomment-2631497662","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102369","id":2631497662,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6c2Xe-","user":{"login":"kiroxas","id":3176062,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNzYwNjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3176062?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas","html_url":"https://github.com/kiroxas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-03T16:32:48Z","updated_at":"2025-02-03T16:34:41Z","body":"Well I understand the logic, but I think this is not good here. The problem is to speed up the text edit thing (as you stated in your initial post), but you chose the solution that produce _slighlty_ worse code than the other **for this problem**. I'm not saying this should be closed, as it's probably a good change, but it's definitely the wrong example to show it in my opinion. I would change `_update_delimiter_cache` to `ptr` call if it speed up long text (and there is probably more things to do there) and try to find an example for this change somewhere where it really matters.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631497662/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631518157","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102369#issuecomment-2631518157","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102369","id":2631518157,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6c2cfN","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-03T16:41:06Z","updated_at":"2025-02-03T16:49:32Z","body":"> Well I understand the logic, but I think this is not good here. The problem is to speed up the text edit thing (as you stated in your initial post), but you chose the solution that produce _slighlty_ worse code than the other **for this problem**. I'm not saying this should be closed, as it's probably a good change, but it's definitely the wrong example to show it in my opinion. I would change `_update_delimiter_cache` to `ptr` call if it speed up long text (and there is probably more things to do there) and try to find an example for this change somewhere where it really matters.\r\n\r\nI'm going off my gut feeling here that the difference between `ptr` and `get_data` is much smaller than the difference between the previous `get_data` and my new implementation. I think the measurements above support this. \r\n\r\n> I would change `_update_delimiter_cache` to `ptr` call if it speed up long text (and there is probably more things to do there)\r\n\r\nTotally agree that `_update_delimiter_cache` should be benchmarked and optimized in general, as it contributes about 6% of the performance problem in #101882 (and likely more if you charge callee time to it). I think that warrants a separate PR though that should benchmark the function fully to see what other optimizations can be conjured up for it.\r\n\r\n> and try to find an example for this change somewhere where it really matters\r\n\r\nI don't think this is necessary. The measurements in `_update_delimiter_cache` show that the change observably improves performance _even without_ touching non-core code. I think that's more than enough reason to merge it. My mantra is more \"make core resilient to misuse\" than \"fix all misuse of core code\". If we tried that, we'd be here a long time :)\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631518157/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2921468774","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102369#issuecomment-2921468774","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102369","id":2921468774,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uIhNm","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-30T07:26:58Z","updated_at":"2025-05-30T07:26:58Z","body":"I understand now why the unit tests had been failing: There are sometimes `String` instances that are of `size() == 1` (i.e. empty). \r\nThis should really be avoided, but it may take a while to get there, especially since GDExtension code may be making the same mistake. For now, this PR can still improve the status quo by making faster assumptions.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2921468774/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2932938106","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102369#issuecomment-2932938106","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102369","id":2932938106,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6u0RV6","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-03T00:00:11Z","updated_at":"2025-06-03T00:00:11Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2932938106/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]